  "method": {
    "requests": "tests/frameworks/trace/requests.cjs: module.registerHooks resolve hook records builtin specifiers requested from node_modules parents.",
    "calls": "tests/frameworks/trace/calls.cjs: wraps public builtin exports, exported-class prototype methods and web-global prototypes; counts a call only when the immediate caller is framework code (node_modules, next-app/.next) or the scenario. Class constructors and static methods are not wrapped, so the call view under-reports (e.g. Readable.from, new Response).",
    "oracle": "node <// Flags:> test/parallel/<fixture> from a byte-identical copy of tests/node/test outside quench-v2 (the root package.json declares type=module, which changes .js fixtures to ESM); NODE_TEST_DIR per fixture; TEST_THREAD_ID per worker; 90 s timeout"
